  "  <div id=\"ap-banner\" hidden style=\"\n       background:#fff3cd;\n       border:1px solid #f0c674;\n       color:#664d03;\n       padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;\n       margin:0 0 0.75rem 0;\n       border-radius:6px;\n       font-size:0.9rem;\n       line-height:1.4;\">\n    <strong>⚠ SoftAP プロビジョニング モード</strong> — Wi-Fi <strong>STA が未接続</strong>です。\n    このページは device 自身の AP <code>http://192.168.4.1/</code> 経由で表示されており、\n    <em>認証パスワードは一時的に無効化</em> されています (物理ボタンで AP を有効化\n    した ≒ 本体アクセス済み)。まず「接続」タブで家庭 Wi-Fi の SSID / パスワードを\n    設定 → 保存 &amp; 再起動してください。ファームを更新する場合は、STA 未接続では\n    リリース取得 (device side fetch) が使えないため、「メンテ」タブの\n    <strong>ローカル ファイル アップロード</strong> を使用してください。\n  </div>": "  <div id=\"ap-banner\" hidden style=\"\n       background:#fff3cd;\n       border:1px solid #f0c674;\n       color:#664d03;\n       padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;\n       margin:0 0 0.75rem 0;\n       border-radius:6px;\n       font-size:0.9rem;\n       line-height:1.4;\">\n    <strong>⚠ SoftAP provisioning mode</strong> — Wi-Fi <strong>is not connected</strong>.\n    This page is served directly from the device's access point\n    <code>http://192.168.4.1/</code>. <em>The authentication password is temporarily disabled</em>\n    (the AP was enabled with the physical button, so the device is already considered trusted).\n    First, set your home Wi-Fi SSID and password on the <strong>Connect</strong> tab, then select\n    <strong>Save &amp; reboot</strong>. To update firmware while STA is disconnected, in-app release\n    download is unavailable; use <strong>Local file upload</strong> on the <strong>Maintenance</strong> tab instead.\n  </div>",
  "  <p class=\"instructions\">\n    ℹ️ タブを切り替えて設定 → <strong>保存 &amp; 再起動</strong> で確定。\n    接続後、即反映する項目 (アバター DSL / LT) は個別ボタンが付いています。\n  </p>": "  <p class=\"instructions\">\n    ℹ️ Switch tabs and configure settings, then select <strong>Save &amp; reboot</strong>.\n    Once connected, settings that apply immediately (Avatar DSL and LT) have their own buttons.\n  </p>",
  "      <p class=\"hint\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.5rem\">\n        device が <code>STA</code> 経由で GitHub Pages から自分宛のビルドを取得し\n        OTA 適用します。AP モード中でも STA がアップであれば動作 (APSTA)。STA が\n        ダウンの場合はエラーになるので、上の「ローカル ファイル」を使ってください。\n      </p>": "      <p class=\"hint\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.5rem\">\n        The device downloads the matching build from GitHub Pages through its STA link and\n        applies it over OTA. This also works in AP mode when STA is connected (APSTA). If STA\n        is down, use <strong>Local file</strong> above instead.\n      </p>",
  "      <p class=\"hint\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.5rem\">\n        サーボの取り付け向きや可動範囲はベース基板で異なります。原点(0..1023)と可動範囲(度)を\n        設定して「保存して再起動」で反映してください。既定は M5 base の値です。\n      </p>": "      <p class=\"hint\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.5rem\">\n        Servo orientation and travel range vary by base board. Set the center (0..1023) and\n        range in degrees, then select <strong>Save &amp; reboot</strong>. Defaults match the M5 base.\n      </p>",
  "        <p class=\"hint\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.5rem\">\n          範囲設定モードを ON にするとサーボの力が抜け、手で動かした位置を取り込めます。\n          中央位置で「Yaw 原点取込」、左端で「Yaw 最小取込」、右端で「Yaw 最大取込」を順にタップしてください。\n          取り込んだ値は上の入力欄に反映されます。最後に「保存 &amp; 再起動」で確定します。\n        </p>": "        <p class=\"hint\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.5rem\">\n          Turning on range-setting mode releases the servos so you can move them by hand.\n          Tap <strong>Capture Yaw center</strong> at the center position, <strong>Capture Yaw minimum</strong>\n          at the left limit, and <strong>Capture Yaw maximum</strong> at the right limit. Important: use the\n          corresponding Yaw and Pitch capture buttons in the order shown. Captured values appear in\n          the fields above. Finally, select <strong>Save &amp; reboot</strong> to apply them.\n        </p>",
  "  const PROX_SECTION_HTML = `\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"prox-section-title\">近接センサー (CoreS3)</h2>\n      <label class=\"toggle-label\" for=\"prox-enabled\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"prox-enabled\">\n        <span>手を近づけると反応する</span>\n      </label>\n      <p class=\"hint\">画面上辺のセンサーに手を近づけると、うれしい顔になって近接フレーズ (音声タブで設定、無ければ吹き出しのみ) を話します。会話中は反応しません。値は反射光量 (0〜2047) で、既定の前段 (ゲイン x64・15 パルス) では何もないとき 200 前後、既定の閾値は near 335 / far 240 です。すべて即時反映。</p>\n      <div class=\"prox-live-box\">\n        <div class=\"prox-live-row\">\n          <span class=\"prox-live-label\">現在値</span>\n          <span id=\"prox-raw\">—</span>\n          <span id=\"prox-state\"></span>\n          <meter id=\"prox-meter\" min=\"0\" max=\"${PROX_METER_MAX}\" value=\"0\"></meter>\n          <label class=\"toggle-label\" for=\"prox-live\" style=\"display:inline-flex;margin:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"prox-live\"><span>リアルタイム更新</span></label>\n        </div>\n        <canvas id=\"prox-spark\" width=\"360\" height=\"60\"></canvas>\n        <div class=\"prox-live-row\">\n          <button type=\"button\" id=\"prox-adopt\" class=\"secondary\">今の値を near にする</button>\n          <span class=\"hint\" style=\"margin:0\">赤の点線 = near、緑 = far。接続すると自動で更新が始まります (0.5 秒ごと)。</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"prox-grid\">\n        <label for=\"prox-near\">near (以上で近い)</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"prox-near\" min=\"0\" max=\"2047\">\n        <label for=\"prox-far\">far (未満で遠い)</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"prox-far\" min=\"0\" max=\"2047\">\n        <label for=\"prox-hold\">判定の連続時間 [ms]</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"prox-hold\" min=\"0\" max=\"5000\">\n        <label for=\"prox-cooldown\">反応の間隔 [s]</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"prox-cooldown\" min=\"0\" max=\"120\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"prox-live-row\">\n        <button type=\"button\" id=\"prox-apply\">閾値を適用 (即時・再起動なし)</button>\n        <span id=\"prox-apply-msg\" class=\"hint\" style=\"margin:0\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"hint\">far は near より小さくしてください (近い→遠いのちらつき防止)。反応が敏感すぎるなら near を上げるか連続時間を伸ばします。上の 4 項目は「閾値を適用」を押した時点で機体に反映・保存されます (ページ下部の保存でも送られます)。</p>\n      <details id=\"prox-tuning\">\n        <summary>センサー調整モード (受光ゲイン / LED / 測定周期 / オフセット)</summary>\n        <p class=\"hint\">LTR-553 の前段を変えると生の値のスケールが変わります。「現在値を表示」を有効にしたまま値を変えて「センサーに適用」を押し、望む距離で十分な差が出る組み合わせを探してから near / far を決め直してください。到達距離を伸ばすなら ゲイン↑・電流↑・パルス数↑ の順に効きます (飽和したら「飽和」と出ます)。オフセットは何もない時の値 (クロストーク) を引き算します。</p>\n        <div class=\"prox-grid\">\n          <label for=\"prox-gain\">受光ゲイン</label>\n          <select id=\"prox-gain\"><option value=\"0\">x16</option><option value=\"1\">x32</option><option value=\"2\">x64</option></select>\n          <label for=\"prox-led-current\">LED 電流</label>\n          <select id=\"prox-led-current\"><option value=\"0\">5 mA</option><option value=\"1\">10 mA</option><option value=\"2\">20 mA</option><option value=\"3\">50 mA</option><option value=\"4\">100 mA</option></select>\n          <label for=\"prox-led-duty\">LED duty</label>\n          <select id=\"prox-led-duty\"><option value=\"0\">25 %</option><option value=\"1\">50 %</option><option value=\"2\">75 %</option><option value=\"3\">100 %</option></select>\n          <label for=\"prox-led-freq\">LED パルス周波数</label>\n          <select id=\"prox-led-freq\"><option value=\"0\">30 kHz</option><option value=\"1\">40 kHz</option><option value=\"2\">50 kHz</option><option value=\"3\">60 kHz</option><option value=\"4\">70 kHz</option><option value=\"5\">80 kHz</option><option value=\"6\">90 kHz</option><option value=\"7\">100 kHz</option></select>\n          <label for=\"prox-pulses\">パルス数 (1〜15)</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"prox-pulses\" min=\"1\" max=\"15\">\n          <label for=\"prox-meas-rate\">測定周期</label>\n          <select id=\"prox-meas-rate\"><option value=\"7\">10 ms</option><option value=\"0\">50 ms</option><option value=\"1\">70 ms</option><option value=\"2\">100 ms</option><option value=\"3\">200 ms</option><option value=\"4\">500 ms</option><option value=\"5\">1000 ms</option><option value=\"6\">2000 ms</option></select>\n          <label for=\"prox-offset\">オフセット (0〜1023)</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"prox-offset\" min=\"0\" max=\"1023\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"prox-live-row\">\n          <button type=\"button\" id=\"prox-tune-apply\">センサーに適用</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" id=\"prox-tune-offset\" class=\"secondary\">今の値をオフセットにする</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" id=\"prox-tune-default\" class=\"secondary\">既定値に戻す</button>\n          <span id=\"prox-tune-msg\" class=\"hint\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"hint\">オフセット: 何もかざしていない状態で「今の値をオフセットにする」→「センサーに適用」すると、床の値 (クロストーク) をチップ内で引き算して 0 付近にできます。ゲインを上げたときは先にこれをやると near / far を小さいままにできます (オフセットは機体ごとに違うので既定値にはしません)。</p>\n      </details>`;": "  const PROX_SECTION_HTML = `\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"prox-section-title\">Proximity sensor (CoreS3)</h2>\n      <label class=\"toggle-label\" for=\"prox-enabled\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"prox-enabled\">\n        <span>React when a hand approaches</span>\n      </label>\n      <p class=\"hint\">Bring your hand near the sensor above the screen to show a happy face and speak a proximity phrase (configured on the Audio tab; if none is set, only the speech bubble appears). It does not react during a conversation. The reading is reflected light (0–2047): with the default front end (gain x64, 15 pulses), an empty scene reads around 200. The default thresholds are near 335 / far 240. All changes apply immediately.</p>\n      <div class=\"prox-live-box\">\n        <div class=\"prox-live-row\">\n          <span class=\"prox-live-label\">Current value</span>\n          <span id=\"prox-raw\">—</span>\n          <span id=\"prox-state\"></span>\n          <meter id=\"prox-meter\" min=\"0\" max=\"${PROX_METER_MAX}\" value=\"0\"></meter>\n          <label class=\"toggle-label\" for=\"prox-live\" style=\"display:inline-flex;margin:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"prox-live\"><span>Live updates</span></label>\n        </div>\n        <canvas id=\"prox-spark\" width=\"360\" height=\"60\"></canvas>\n        <div class=\"prox-live-row\">\n          <button type=\"button\" id=\"prox-adopt\" class=\"secondary\">Use current value as near</button>\n          <span class=\"hint\" style=\"margin:0\">Red dotted line = near; green = far. Updates start automatically when connected (every 0.5 seconds).</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"prox-grid\">\n        <label for=\"prox-near\">near (at or above = close)</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"prox-near\" min=\"0\" max=\"2047\">\n        <label for=\"prox-far\">far (below = distant)</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"prox-far\" min=\"0\" max=\"2047\">\n        <label for=\"prox-hold\">Hold time [ms]</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"prox-hold\" min=\"0\" max=\"5000\">\n        <label for=\"prox-cooldown\">Cooldown [s]</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"prox-cooldown\" min=\"0\" max=\"120\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"prox-live-row\">\n        <button type=\"button\" id=\"prox-apply\">Apply thresholds (immediate; no reboot)</button>\n        <span id=\"prox-apply-msg\" class=\"hint\" style=\"margin:0\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"hint\">Keep far below near to prevent close/distant flicker. If the sensor is too sensitive, increase near or the hold time. These four values are sent and saved to the device when you select <strong>Apply thresholds</strong> (the Save button at the bottom also sends them).</p>\n      <details id=\"prox-tuning\">\n        <summary>Sensor tuning (receiver gain / LED / measurement rate / offset)</summary>\n        <p class=\"hint\">Changing the LTR-553 front end changes the scale of the raw reading. Keep <strong>Live updates</strong> enabled, adjust the values, and select <strong>Apply to sensor</strong>. Find a combination that gives enough separation at the distance you want, then set near / far again. To increase range, try higher gain first, then higher LED current, then more pulses. The state shows <strong>Saturated</strong> when the receiver clips. Offset subtracts the no-target baseline (crosstalk).</p>\n        <div class=\"prox-grid\">\n          <label for=\"prox-gain\">Receiver gain</label>\n          <select id=\"prox-gain\"><option value=\"0\">x16</option><option value=\"1\">x32</option><option value=\"2\">x64</option></select>\n          <label for=\"prox-led-current\">LED current</label>\n          <select id=\"prox-led-current\"><option value=\"0\">5 mA</option><option value=\"1\">10 mA</option><option value=\"2\">20 mA</option><option value=\"3\">50 mA</option><option value=\"4\">100 mA</option></select>\n          <label for=\"prox-led-duty\">LED duty</label>\n          <select id=\"prox-led-duty\"><option value=\"0\">25 %</option><option value=\"1\">50 %</option><option value=\"2\">75 %</option><option value=\"3\">100 %</option></select>\n          <label for=\"prox-led-freq\">LED pulse frequency</label>\n          <select id=\"prox-led-freq\"><option value=\"0\">30 kHz</option><option value=\"1\">40 kHz</option><option value=\"2\">50 kHz</option><option value=\"3\">60 kHz</option><option value=\"4\">70 kHz</option><option value=\"5\">80 kHz</option><option value=\"6\">90 kHz</option><option value=\"7\">100 kHz</option></select>\n          <label for=\"prox-pulses\">Pulse count (1 to 15)</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"prox-pulses\" min=\"1\" max=\"15\">\n          <label for=\"prox-meas-rate\">Measurement rate</label>\n          <select id=\"prox-meas-rate\"><option value=\"7\">10 ms</option><option value=\"0\">50 ms</option><option value=\"1\">70 ms</option><option value=\"2\">100 ms</option><option value=\"3\">200 ms</option><option value=\"4\">500 ms</option><option value=\"5\">1000 ms</option><option value=\"6\">2000 ms</option></select>\n          <label for=\"prox-offset\">Offset (0–1023)</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"prox-offset\" min=\"0\" max=\"1023\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"prox-live-row\">\n          <button type=\"button\" id=\"prox-tune-apply\">Apply to sensor</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" id=\"prox-tune-offset\" class=\"secondary\">Use current value as offset</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" id=\"prox-tune-default\" class=\"secondary\">Restore defaults</button>\n          <span id=\"prox-tune-msg\" class=\"hint\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"hint\">To compensate for crosstalk, hold nothing in front of the sensor, select <strong>Use current value as offset</strong>, then <strong>Apply to sensor</strong>. The chip subtracts that baseline and the reading returns near zero. Do this before increasing gain to keep near / far small. Offsets vary by device, so this is not a fixed default.</p>\n      </details>`;",
